### Health check
GET http://localhost:3001/

### List all employees
GET http://localhost:3001/employees

### Search (name / empId / email / department)
GET http://localhost:3001/employees?q=aisyah

### Sort by salary, highest first
GET http://localhost:3001/employees?sortBy=salary&order=desc

### Create
POST http://localhost:3001/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empId": "EMP010",
  "name": "Test Employee",
  "email": "test.employee@company.com.my",
  "department": "IT",
  "position": "Intern",
  "hireDate": "2025-01-15",
  "salary": 2000,
  "active": true
}

### Update (replace 8 with the id returned above)
PUT http://localhost:3001/employees/8
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empId": "EMP010",
  "name": "Test Employee (updated)",
  "email": "test.employee@company.com.my",
  "department": "Operations",
  "position": "Coordinator",
  "hireDate": "2025-02-01",
  "salary": 4200,
  "active": true
}

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:3001/employees/8
